  "details": "Having a soundboard may be possibly one of the most useful things for mutes and people who don't want to use voice communication. While gestures are being used as a temporary substitute, they don't give a lot of options, and are extremely limited, forcing players to reupload and switch avatars just to play different audio with the same avatar. \n\nJust like cameras, it could be used as a personal tool, and, hopefully, it shouldn't be too hard to make.",
